==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{term|casse|lang=fro}} (case) + ''[[-ette]]'' (diminutive), hence a small case; cognate with Italian {{term|cassetta|lang=it}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=fr|/ka.sɛt/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/ka.sEt/}}
* {{audio|Fr-cassette.ogg|Audio (France, Paris)}}
* {{homophones|cassettes|lang=fr}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|f}}

# [[treasure]] [[box]]
#: ''La '''cassette''' du roi.''
# any small [[box]]
#: ''Une '''cassette''' à compartiments.''
# a cassette tape
#: ''Un magnétophone à cassette.''

